<title>HUNGARY: TVK H1 '97 net income HUF 8.016 bln.</title>
<headline>TVK H1 '97 net income HUF 8.016 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					   Jan-June 1997   Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Operating profit			8,730    vs    5,205</p>
<p>Profit before interest, extraord.</p>
<p>     income, and tax			8,881    vs    5,919</p>
<p>Profit before tax and extraord.</p>
<p>     income				   9,699    vs    6,350</p>
<p>    Net income				8,016    vs    5,350</p>
<p>    Net sales				40,681    vs   31,082</p>
<p>    Cost of sales			  27,659    vs   21,969</p>
<p>    Gross profit			   13,022    vs    9,113</p>
<p>    General and administrative costs  4,292    vs    3,908</p>
<p>    Other revenue			   1,568    vs    2,528</p>
<p>    Other expenditure		     1,417    vs    1,814</p>
<p>    Interest revenue			1,139    vs	692</p>
<p>    Interest expenditure		    321    vs	261</p>
<p>    Taxation				  1,683    vs    1,000</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items			 0.0  vs	  0.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Tiszai Vegyi Kombinat Rt (TVK) is a chemicals company. The figures were calculated in accordance with International Accounting Standards. The figures are not consolidated and are unaudited.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
